{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act43side_level_act43side_01_end","storyGroup":"act43side","storySort":3,"storyDependence":"act43side_level_act43side_01_beg","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"AD-1","storyName":"彩排日","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"长久以来卢西恩一直在验证自己的臆想——剧团长或许已死而复生。蓝卡坞拍卖会上带有剧团印记的剧本、进入剧组后发生的意外似乎都在告诉卢西恩，这次他或许找对了。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act43side/level_act43side_01_end","avgTag":"行动后","unLockType":"BY_START_TIME","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act43side_01","minState":"PASS","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":1,"next":3,"characters":["拍卖师","？？？","格蕾塔","卢西恩","Miss.Christine"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":1},{"type":"stopmusic","id":2},{"type":"dialog","id":3},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":4},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","fadetime":"0","keep":"true","initamount":"0","amount":"1","block":"true","id":5},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/15/Avg_bg_56_g12_saluzzowinery.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":6},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":7},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":8},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","fadetime":"2","amount":"0","block":"true","id":9},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$m_dia_street_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta3_181101/m_dia_street_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":10,"musicid":0},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_crwddiscuss_outside","loop":"true","channel":"bgs","volume":"0","id":11},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.2","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"2","id":12},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1257_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":13},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":14},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拍卖师","text":"第一次参加本活动的朋友们，如果您期待的是炎国字画或是萨尔贡秘宝，就可以转身离去了。","id":15,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/29/Avg_avg_npc_1257_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拍卖师","text":"“剧本拍卖”，作为蓝卡坞最具特色的活动，这里仅出售尚未成稿的剧本创意、粗纲和相关版权。","id":16,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/29/Avg_avg_npc_1257_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拍卖师","text":"也就是说，不像传统拍卖行会负责鉴定拍品的真假，我们并不保证拍品的实际价值——","id":17,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/29/Avg_avg_npc_1257_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拍卖师","text":"它是否具有市场潜力，是否具有艺术价值，未来会成为叫好又叫座的作品被写进蓝卡坞的历史，还是赔钱货……","id":18,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/29/Avg_avg_npc_1257_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拍卖师","text":"均依赖各位自己去判断。","id":19,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/29/Avg_avg_npc_1257_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拍卖师","text":"为保护拍品的知识产权，请各位收起终端，关闭录音设备，接下来请容许我介绍今晚的第一件拍品——","id":20,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/29/Avg_avg_npc_1257_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拍卖师","text":"《杜邦夫人之死》，这个故事发生于哥伦比亚，讲述了两大家族在时代交替中的兴衰爱恨，最低交易价——十万金券。","id":21,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/29/Avg_avg_npc_1257_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拍卖师","text":"十万！后面先生出价十万……十五！感谢左手边这位年轻美丽的小姐……还有其他来宾竞价吗？","id":22,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/29/Avg_avg_npc_1257_1$1.png"},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_auctionhammer","text":"","id":23},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拍卖师","text":"十五万一次……","id":24,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/29/Avg_avg_npc_1257_1$1.png"},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_auctionhammer","channel":"2","text":"","id":25},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拍卖师","text":"十五万两次……","id":26,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/29/Avg_avg_npc_1257_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":27},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"六十万。","id":28},{"type":"dialog","id":29},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.5","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"2","id":30},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":31},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1257_1#1$1","id":32},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拍卖师","text":"！","id":33,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/29/Avg_avg_npc_1257_1$1.png"},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"3","id":34},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拍卖师","text":"（小声）格蕾塔女士！您今天是来砸场子的吗！第一件拍品就开价这么高，后面的气氛只会越来越冷，其他拍品可怎么办……","id":35,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/29/Avg_avg_npc_1257_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":36},{"type":"charslot","id":37},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1834_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":38},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":39},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"按规矩抬价太浪费时间，我只是报出了我心中它值得的价格。","id":40,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a6/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1257_1#1$1","id":41},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拍卖师","text":"花大价钱在剧本上赌博，是您的作风，但可不经济啊……我听说前段时间您投资制作的电影接二连三赔钱，现在手头不宽裕吧？","id":42,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/29/Avg_avg_npc_1257_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1834_1#1$1","id":43},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"我还付得起你的中介费，快落槌吧，老朋友。","id":44,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a6/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"我在你这儿看上了一个资质出挑的年轻人，正急着找他聊聊呢。","id":45,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a6/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":46},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":47},{"type":"charslot","id":48},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":49},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":50},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":51},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1834_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":52},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":53},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"威士忌，不加冰，谢谢。","id":54,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a6/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"也请你喝一杯，先生？","id":55,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a6/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":56},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"char_250_phantom_1#1","duration":"1.5","id":57},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":58},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"char_250_phantom_1#1","focus":"l","id":59},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"我的医生规劝我不要饮酒。","id":60,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3e/Avg_char_250_phantom_1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1834_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":61},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"听口音……你是萨尔贡人？","id":62,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a6/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"真有意思，你这张冷峻忧郁的脸，明明是标准的维多利亚人长相。","id":63,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a6/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"char_250_phantom_1#6","focus":"l","id":64},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"（萨尔贡语）我刚涉过萨尔贡的黄沙。","id":65,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c2/Avg_char_250_phantom_6.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"（口音纯正的维多利亚语）但确实生于维多利亚。","id":66,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c2/Avg_char_250_phantom_6.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1834_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":67},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"你的语言切换十分流畅，口音也挑不出毛病。不过除了这两个国家，我还在你身上发现了其他文化的痕迹和习惯。","id":68,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a6/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"char_250_phantom_1#6","focus":"l","id":69},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"玻利瓦尔、叙拉古、莱塔尼亚、雷姆必拓……现在又来到蓝卡坞。","id":70,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c2/Avg_char_250_phantom_6.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1834_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":71},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"——全泰拉最具娱乐性的移动城市，气候宜人、阳光充足的拍摄地。你为什么来到这里？","id":72,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a6/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"度假、游学？还是像外面那些慕名而来，最终都挤在群演市场的人们一样，在寻找工作机会？","id":73,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a6/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"char_250_phantom_1#2","focus":"l","id":74},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"找一个人。","id":75,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a1/Avg_char_250_phantom_2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"char_250_phantom_1#7","focus":"l","id":76},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"漫长的时间里，我循着他的影子，走过许多地方。","id":77,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fc/Avg_char_250_phantom_7.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1834_1#3$1","focus":"r","id":78},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"哦？什么人？我认识所有在主城区和移动地块上拍戏的剧组，说不定能帮上你的忙。","id":79,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5f/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"char_250_phantom_1#6","focus":"l","id":80},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"不劳费心。","id":81,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c2/Avg_char_250_phantom_6.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1834_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":82},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"好吧，好吧……可惜……","id":83,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a6/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"char_250_phantom_1#6","focus":"l","id":84},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"如果你没有别的事……","id":85,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c2/Avg_char_250_phantom_6.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1834_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":86},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"格蕾塔·斯通，我的名字，蓝卡坞电影制片人……在这一行的新闻里出现次数还挺多的。","id":87,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a6/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"我本来还以为你是哪里的贵公子，或是来碰碰运气的电影学院的学生，想着邀请你加入我的剧组。","id":88,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a6/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"参加蓝卡坞剧本拍卖会的人多少都会对艺术抱有热情，再加上你的气质很独特……","id":89,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a6/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"char_250_phantom_1#1","focus":"l","id":90},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"我曾在维多利亚的一个小剧团担任演员。","id":91,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3e/Avg_char_250_phantom_1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1834_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":92},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"我就说我的眼光不可能错，你天生适合银幕！","id":93,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1834_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":94},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"不过现在说这些也没用，既然你有必须要做的事，看来今天我只能空手而归了。","id":95,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a6/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"char_250_phantom_1#1","focus":"l","id":96},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"我能否看看剧本？","id":97,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3e/Avg_char_250_phantom_1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1834_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":98},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"当然！","id":99,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":100},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_paper1","id":101},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"char_250_phantom_1#6","focus":"l","id":102},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":103},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"char_250_phantom_1#4","focus":"l","id":104},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"……","id":105,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/70/Avg_char_250_phantom_4.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1834_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":106},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"这份剧本原稿只是一个开始，我还会投入更多人力、资金、时间，让它成为轰动影史的旷世佳作。","id":107,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a6/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"哪怕你只扮演一个小角色，只在一幕戏里登场，也能出彩。","id":108,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a6/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"你身上那些特殊的小问题也不用担心。蓝卡坞出台了专门的感染者演员劳动保护条例，只要你支付了足够的保险金——","id":109,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a6/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"char_250_phantom_1#6","focus":"l","id":110},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"叫我卢西恩吧，格蕾塔女士。","id":111,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c2/Avg_char_250_phantom_6.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"我会考虑你的提议。","id":112,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c2/Avg_char_250_phantom_6.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":113},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":114},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","fadetime":"2","keep":"true","initamount":"0","amount":"1","block":"true","id":115},{"type":"dialog","id":116},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":117},{"type":"charslot","id":118},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","fadetime":"0","amount":"0","block":"true","id":119},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1b/Avg_bg_62_g10_dormitory.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":120},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1834_1#4$1","id":121},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1828_1#1$1","id":122},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":123},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":124},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act28side/m_avg_wasteland_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":125,"musicid":1},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1834_1#4$1","focus":"r","id":126},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"我必须再次向你致歉，卢西恩。","id":127,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f1/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"你初次接触电影，深思熟虑了很长时间才下定决心在演员合约上签字。我本应像我承诺的那样，让你体会到拍摄的乐趣。","id":128,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f1/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"谁能想到，你在蓝卡坞的第一场戏就亲历了如此可怕的事故……","id":129,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f1/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"如果你需要一些时间来调整自己的状态，我很理解。我会让谢莉更改你下一场戏的拍摄时间。","id":130,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f1/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"但要是你想直接毁约离开剧组，那恐怕行不通。移动地块已经开出了短驳运输车的调用范围，直到租赁合约到期才会返航……","id":131,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f1/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1828_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":132},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"我不会离开。","id":133,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1f/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"也不用更改日程。","id":134,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1f/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1834_1#3$1","focus":"r","id":135},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"不用？这起事故造成的创伤性记忆很可能会阻碍你的表演，甚至影响你的生活。","id":136,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5f/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1828_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":137},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"舞台之上，意外于我并不陌生。","id":138,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1834_1#4$1","focus":"r","id":139},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"你习惯了舞台剧的演出方式，它的不确定性诚然比在镜头中表演更强，不过那终究是戏。","id":140,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f1/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1828_1#5$1","focus":"l","id":141},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"“戏”……或许吧。","id":142,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ea/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":143},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4198_christ_1#1$1","duration":"1","posfrom":"-500,0","posto":"-500,0","id":144},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":145},{"type":"text","text":"神秘优雅的生物不知何时又一次出现在卢西恩脚边，她亲昵地蹭了蹭菲林的小腿，对格蕾塔的出现视而不见。","id":146},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1834_1#4$1","focus":"r","id":147},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"卢西恩先生，你确定不需要休息？你可以多享受一下Miss.Christine的陪伴。","id":148,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f1/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1828_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":149},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"她和我都在期待之后的故事。","id":150,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1834_1#6$1","focus":"r","id":151},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"你对今天那件事的反应比我想象中镇定太多……既然你如此笃定，那我再有顾虑就显得失礼了。","id":152,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/66/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"我们明天拍摄现场见。","id":153,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/66/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":154},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"0.7","id":155},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"200,0","duration":"1","afrom":"1","ato":"0","id":156},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":157},{"type":"playsound","key":"$doorclosequite","id":158},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":159},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","focus":"m","id":160},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Miss.Christine","text":"……","id":161},{"type":"text","text":"神秘优雅的生物梳理了一下自己的毛发，她盯着卢西恩，若有所思的样子。","id":162},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1828_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":163},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"Miss.Christine？","id":164,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":165},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4198_christ_1#2$1","duration":"0.3","id":166},{"type":"text","text":"两条尾巴在空中自由地摆动，摇曳出几道模糊的黑影。","id":167},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","posfrom":"-500,0","posto":"-400,0","duration":"1","id":168},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":169},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"0.3","id":170},{"type":"delay","time":"0.3","id":171},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4198_christ_1#2$1","duration":"0.5","posfrom":"100,0","posto":"100,0","id":172},{"type":"text","text":"她漂浮起来绕着卢西恩的肩头转了一圈，好像是在观察，又似乎是在品味。","id":173},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4198_christ_1#6$1","duration":"0.3","id":174},{"type":"text","text":"最终美丽的生物落在卢西恩的膝盖上，提起一只爪子轻轻抵在他的额前。卢西恩感到一阵恬适的暖意。","id":175},{"type":"dialog","id":176},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.6","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":177},{"type":"subtitle","text":"酸涩。","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":178},{"type":"subtitle","id":179},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":180},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":181},{"type":"text","text":"空荡的房间响起神秘的声音，卢西恩没有费力寻找它的来源，他平静地与一动未动的Miss.Christine对视。","id":182},{"type":"text","text":"他知道这是对方在他脑中投射的言语。","id":183},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1828_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":184},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"你习惯用沉默与伪装避免麻烦，很少在无关紧要的时候开口。","id":185,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1f/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"我的情绪难以下咽至此吗，女士？","id":186,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1f/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4198_christ_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":187},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Miss.Christine","text":"我并不讨厌。就算不是偏爱的口味，我也乐于尝试。","id":188,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/99/Avg_avg_4198_christ_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Miss.Christine","text":"你在想什么？刚刚那条能言会道的小蛇不足以勾起你如此复杂的情绪。","id":189,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/99/Avg_avg_4198_christ_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1828_1#4$1","focus":"l","id":190},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"在剧团生活的无数回忆之一。","id":191,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/13/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"剧团长看出我的早悟，亲自教导我如何使用武器。","id":192,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/13/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1828_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":193},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"今天握住刀时的感受与那天一模一样。","id":194,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1f/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4198_christ_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":195},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Miss.Christine","text":"那我就能理解余味中的辛辣与回甘从何而来了。","id":196,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/01/Avg_avg_4198_christ_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Miss.Christine","text":"你在剧团时体会的矛盾与挣扎，那些人类称之为痛苦和悲剧的时刻，现在已经调理成气味诱人的餐点，我很喜欢。","id":197,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/01/Avg_avg_4198_christ_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1828_1#5$1","focus":"l","id":198},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"因为杀死他之后，我仍在追寻他。","id":199,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ea/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"残存的剧团信徒，偏僻村落的怪诞传说，还有那枚张扬的印记……一路以来，我都在试图验证我冥冥中的臆想……","id":200,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ea/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"他或许，已经死而复生。","id":201,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ea/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4198_christ_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":202},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Miss.Christine","text":"那条小蛇拍下的故事透着令人上瘾的古怪气味。","id":203,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e2/Avg_avg_4198_christ_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1828_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":204},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"感谢你提醒我。翻看剧本时我已确认，书缝之中刻着剧团的双生相印。","id":205,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"角色的偶然正是作者设置的必然，看似与剧团无关的格蕾塔女士成为了我们的领路人。","id":206,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"即便如此我仍无法确信。他留下的谜题真假参半，过去十年中我们已领教多次。","id":207,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"直到今天道尔顿死于我的刀下，相似的感受勾连起过去的回忆……","id":208,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1828_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":209},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"这是他的邀请。","id":210,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1f/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"Miss.Christine，或许……我们来对了。","id":211,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1f/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_MCcat_2","volume":"1","id":212},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4198_christ_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":213},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Miss.Christine","text":"喵~","id":214,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/01/Avg_avg_4198_christ_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":215},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":216},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":217},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":218},{"type":"image","id":219},{"type":"charslot","id":220}],"characters":["拍卖师","？？？","格蕾塔","卢西恩","Miss.Christine"]}